OL,3,GNEWSABlackpool Illuminations depot
OL,4,Aseeks lighting fix
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlackpool's Illuminations are famous
OL,7,Fthe world over but the council is
OL,8,Fironically looking to borrow #90,000 to
OL,9,Fprovide lighting for the building where
OL,10,Fthey are stored and repaired.
OL,12,FThe Illuminations Service has been
OL,13,Fbased at the Lightworks building, on
OL,14,FAmy Johnson Way, since 2010, after
OL,15,Fmoving from the old depot on Rigby
OL,16,FRoad.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
