OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1789122357
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABlackpool Illuminations depot
OL,4,Aseeks lighting fix
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report to Blackpool Council's
OL,7,FExecutive Committee said the building's
OL,8,Flighting was no longer serviceable as
OL,9,Fparts for the non-LED lighting are now
OL,10,Fno longer available and emergency
OL,11,Flighting had also failed due to the age
OL,12,Fof the equipment.
OL,14,FThe council is also seeking a loan of
OL,15,Fan additional #230,000 to purchase
OL,16,Fvehicles and plant for the depot.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
